{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方金色大字“憋着一股气”首先吸引视线，随后注意到下方同样醒目的灰白色大字“那点高兴还没退”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。只能感觉到人物似乎有情绪压抑，但具体处境看不出来。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、压着一股气，同时残留着一点尚未消退的高兴。\",\n  \"missed\": \"想往前走却脚下乱了步子的具体处境，以及和弦、切分节奏、旋律交织所对应的心理状态。右上角还有离开后才发现心里空了的阶段信息，但不容易在第一眼注意到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块字号都很大的标题需要先后获取，核心情绪并非集中在一个完整表达中。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在标题和下方正文里，要拼起来才懂。\",\n    \"正文连续包含多层意思，需要进一步阅读才能判断人物的具体处境及情绪之间的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "228caadf-43d8-488d-9681-94bad5e37fc1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022532958348Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:25:54.676124+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "99cfe4f127421677cd28bf60e18a6d137c861cfeff26b6f4fdbc56d13a17ffc3", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683",